  "rationale": "Block tokenCache:credentialAccess and backupHost:lateralMovement. Blocking tokenCache stops apiToken, dbLogin and rdpLogin. That cuts off printServer, jumpHost and hypervisor, so shareMount and dbReplica (via jumpHost) are unreachable, and printServer can no longer feed vaultRead. Blocking backupHost cuts the remaining codeRepo path and also stops serviceAccount and secretsManager, so vaultRead and dbReplica (via secretsManager) are unreachable too. One block is not enough: backupHost stays reachable through kerberoast from the entry footholds regardless of tokenCache, and printServer stays reachable through dbLogin and rdpLogin regardless of backupHost. No single step sits on both paths."
 },
